{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RBXFwxTUCMp8kEWZxdxLQo","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"The KIP-1271 proposal introduced a new configuration property `streams.store.headers.max.bytes` to cap the size of headers that could be written into Kafka Streams state stores, but this property was removed from the final design by mid-January 2026.\\\\n\\\\n- 2026-01-09 22:14:18 Z - Alieh Saeedi opens KIP-1271, stating it “introduces header-aware store types and a small config to cap the size of headers written into state”[mail:ff47cb0b3f9a6f3692cca972].  \\\\n- 2026-01-12 01:39:08 Z - Matthias J. Sax questions the need for `streams.store.headers.max.bytes`[mail:74c7bc2a8a27285aa6784839].  \\\\n- 2026-01-12 21:07:50 Z - Alieh Saeedi replies that the maximum header length is fixed at 2 bytes (64 KB) and that the configuration can be removed[mail:fddcc74d4df53f96c1a36885], indicating the property was deemed unnecessary and dropped from the final design.\\\\n\\\\nNo later discussion in the thread cites the configuration, confirming its removal by mid-January 2026. No evidence indicates the property was retained.\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"mail:ff47cb0b3f9a6f3692cca972\\\",\\\"mail:74c7bc2a8a27285aa6784839\\\",\\\"mail:fddcc74d4df53f96c1a36885\\\",\\\"mail:39a5409dbf9aeaf60eed6553\\\",\\\"mail:cc6691acddb4132e5b46a141\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":75.192,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":31,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":null,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":null,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.01040521,\\\"input_tokens\\\":326950,\\\"output_tokens\\\":25808}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9dfb79b8-c5da-4b0d-b81f-f8f1c8693041","uuid":"dadd06c7-3a1f-4175-abe5-b25c0e8b6f12","timestamp":"2026-09-29T14:46:14.629Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"The KIP-1271 proposal introduced a new configuration property `streams.store.headers.max.bytes` to cap the size of headers that could be written into Kafka Streams state stores, but this property was removed from the final design by mid-January 2026.\\\\n\\\\n- 2026-01-09 22:14:18 Z - Alieh Saeedi opens KIP-1271, stating it “introduces header-aware store types and a small config to cap the size of headers written into state”[mail:ff47cb0b3f9a6f3692cca972].  \\\\n- 2026-01-12 01:39:08 Z - Matthias J. Sax questions the need for `streams.store.headers.max.bytes`[mail:74c7bc2a8a27285aa6784839].  \\\\n- 2026-01-12 21:07:50 Z - Alieh Saeedi replies that the maximum header length is fixed at 2 bytes (64 KB) and that the configuration can be removed[mail:fddcc74d4df53f96c1a36885], indicating the property was deemed unnecessary and dropped from the final design.\\\\n\\\\nNo later discussion in the thread cites the configuration, confirming its removal by mid-January 2026. No evidence indicates the property was retained.\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"mail:ff47cb0b3f9a6f3692cca972\\\",\\\"mail:74c7bc2a8a27285aa6784839\\\",\\\"mail:fddcc74d4df53f96c1a36885\\\",\\\"mail:39a5409dbf9aeaf60eed6553\\\",\\\"mail:cc6691acddb4132e5b46a141\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":75.192,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":31,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":null,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":null,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.01040521,\\\"input_tokens\\\":326950,\\\"output_tokens\\\":25808}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"The KIP-1271 proposal introduced a new configuration property `streams.store.headers.max.bytes` to cap the size of headers that could be written into Kafka Streams state stores, but this property was removed from the final design by mid-January 2026.\\n\\n- 2026-01-09 22:14:18 Z - Alieh Saeedi opens KIP-1271, stating it “introduces header-aware store types and a small config to cap the size of headers written into state”[mail:ff47cb0b3f9a6f3692cca972].  \\n- 2026-01-12 01:39:08 Z - Matthias J. Sax questions the need for `streams.store.headers.max.bytes`[mail:74c7bc2a8a27285aa6784839].  \\n- 2026-01-12 21:07:50 Z - Alieh Saeedi replies that the maximum header length is fixed at 2 bytes (64 KB) and that the configuration can be removed[mail:fddcc74d4df53f96c1a36885], indicating the property was deemed unnecessary and dropped from the final design.\\n\\nNo later discussion in the thread cites the configuration, confirming its removal by mid-January 2026. No evidence indicates the property was retained.\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"mail:ff47cb0b3f9a6f3692cca972\",\"mail:74c7bc2a8a27285aa6784839\",\"mail:fddcc74d4df53f96c1a36885\",\"mail:39a5409dbf9aeaf60eed6553\",\"mail:cc6691acddb4132e5b46a141\"],\"seconds\":75.192,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":31,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":null,\"cache_write_tokens\":null,\"cost_usd\":0.01040521,\"input_tokens\":326950,\"output_tokens\":25808}}"}}}
